 "notes": "Day 45, the finale of season 1 (גנב הכתר), approved for Saturday 28.11 19:00. No landmark: the reveal. The thief is the court jester, caught by the backstage net; the crown comes back to the statue (castle.stolen 1 to 0). Only turtle.595985 guessed ליצן before the reveal (day 36, comment 18132651244696876): בלש הממלכה + a wish. No resident joined on day 44, so the gold key went by the fallback rule (citizens without a key, index (45*7919) % 159): eliya_hajaj1234567. Teaser for season 2: a giant glowing egg by the palace."
